<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Night Vision</ansi> mutation

Your eyes reshape themselves, pupils dilating impossibly wide.
Darkness becomes merely dim, though bright light stings more than it
should.

<ansi fg="yellow">Requires:</ansi>  Eyes
<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  See clearly in darkness — no light source required to navigate
  or notice things in unlit areas

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Slightly reduced perception — your eyes sacrifice some fine
  detail discrimination for light sensitivity

<ansi fg="yellow">Conflicts:</ansi> Infrared Vision

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
